# File and class size limits

Hard limits:

- **Max 400 lines** per source file (Python/CSS/other; JS dashboard/device UI may use **500** — see `solid-javascript`)
- **Max 30 methods/functions** per class
- **Max 60 lines** per function / method body (extract helpers)

## Required behavior

1. Split before exceeding limits (one responsibility / one type per file)
2. Prefer extracting helpers/views/services over growing a god-class
3. Generated bundles may exceed limits; do not hand-edit them
4. Never put a second class/TypedDict/Enum in the same file to “save a split”
5. No nested classes / nested defs — see `no-nested-classes`

## Python exemption (rare)

```python
# solid-function-max-lines: <reason>
```

Place the marker on the line immediately above the `def` (or its decorators).
